# Feature / assembly / drawing probes are experimental

`src/creopdm/static/feature_probe/`, `assembly_probe/`, and `drawing_probe/` are throwaway Creo.JS experiments.

## Do not

- Add or restore unit/contract tests for these pages (`test_*probe*`, or any pytest under `tests/` that reads those static folders)
- Treat probe regressions as requiring the “bug → unit test” rule

Iterate by editing the probe files and trying them in Creo. Lessons roll into the app later with normal app tests.
